// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2508476742" "We've got a problem.<br><br>No, not between you and me, I like you. No, I mean, we're chummy... Let's have this conversation later.<br><br>Back to the trouble at hand. The clockwork are planting bombs around the enclosure and I need you to disarm them."
// AcceptString :
"P1532734585" "Disarm the bombs"
// SendOffString :
"P3420211170" "The Clockwork must have some sort of contingency programming to destroy the enclosure themselves if the remote signal didn't work. If it wasn't so dangerous I'd find it fascinating.<br><br>There are 5 bombs to disarm. Once you disarm a bomb you will need to defeat five Clockwork in the area to disrupt their attempts to replace the explosives. Once you've disarmed the bombs, return to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
