"P3089655119" "Disarm the first bomb"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2898565308" "You've got to get those bombs disarmed before they start going off and kill us all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P572905281" "You disarmed the first bomb!"

