// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2698255324" "Warning. P-string error detected.<em t=3>P523478901.<em t=2>P-string error corrected. Die primal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3187060158" "Whew. With those bombs disarmed and the suitable thrashing you gave the Clockwork, I'm pretty certain they won't try that anytime soon.<br><br>The Clockwork are, however, persistent, and it is likely that any situational change might resonate in their artificial brains as a reason to attempt the endeavor once more. If that time comes, I hope I can count on you to stop them once more.<br><br>Speaking of artifical brains, I haven't had a chance to work on IVy's emotional programming since this whole debacle began. Oh, I hope she isn't frightening people away with her emotional outbursts..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DrKeppelReport2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DrLetaReport2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WaveSignatureTracker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1104474098" "Wave Signature Tracker"
// DetailString :
"P3563065524" "This tiny device, about the size of a credit card, designates the current whereabouts of the primal villains. They're not far outside of the enclosure shield, in the surrounding Praetorian Forest, which crawls with the devouring earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P372595551" "I need you to deliver a report to Dr. Leta over in Facility B. I hope everything is going as well over there as it is here... Not that we're sipping martinis over here or anything."
// AcceptString :
"P2495861573" "Deliver report to Dr. Leta"
// SendOffString :
"P4226515452" "Dr. Leta will have a report for me as well, or, she should.<br><br>I hope she does, anyway..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1001049960" "Dr. Leta needs to see this report ASAP."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1909878370" "A report from Keppel? Let me see that!<br><br>Rubbish. Unimportant. Gibberish. Ugh.<br><br>Listen, primal. We've got bigger problems. Take this report back to Keppel, he'll understand what I'm talking about. I have more important things to deal with over here than baby sitting Keppel's lab aides."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1651697836" "Deliver report to Dr. Keppel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3957741638" "Dr. Keppel should see this report immediately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3101016618" "She sent a report!? Let me see it, quick.<br><br>Huh. Hmmm. This is not what I expected.<br><br>{HeroName}, I need your help. Some escaped primals managed to get out of the Enclosure and appear to be hellbent on capturing one of the devoured and bringing it back into the enclosure with them.<br><br>I don't know if primal earth has the ill fortune of being afflicted with the Hamidon, but if one of the infected devoured gets loose on your planet then it will be doomed.<br><br>You must stop those primals before it is too late. Here is a wave scanner to track the villains. I've also keyed your wave signature into the shield doors. You should be able to pass through them now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2978338741" "Stop Villains"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1451582" "You've got to stop those villains. We can't afford to let even one of those things in here. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3616828523" "For a forest that will probably try to devour you any second now, this is kinda pretty."

