// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - StopTheVillains 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P481485550" "Villains to Stop"
// SingularDescription :
"P322613532" "Stop the last Villain"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P872793233" "You've stopped the villains and their plan to take a devoured back to Primal Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P881018991" "You stopped the primals!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1073402459" "I was worried that the door scanners wouldn't let you back in due to infection, but thankfully you are made of tougher stuff. Speaking of tough, I've developed a new armor suit composed of an alloy I call Keppelium. <br><br>It uses extreme memory alloy technology and advanced synaptic relays to create a reactive metal fabric that acts similar to chainmail but flexes and becomes rigid against blows as needed by the wearer. Unfortunately I can't get the signal strength correct and I'm afraid a suit of it would probably wring you out like a wet washcloth the first time you flinched... oh well, back to the drawing board."
// RandomFameString :
"P3958075051" "string"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2-9_RE_Keppel_H_Task5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1594612830" "Well, that didn't take them very long.<br><br>The clockwork are attempting to circumvent my brilliant jammers by setting up a communication relay outside of the enclosure. I need you to go out there and take them down, because if you don't, they'll probably succeed and we'll all die in an anti-proton firestorm."
// AcceptString :
"P1513734176" "Destroy Clockwork communications"
// SendOffString :
"P3707659551" "I'm glad we both have a positive outlook on remaining in a solid state rather than being forcibly transformed into a gaseous state. I've keyed your wave signature into the enclosure shield doors. You will be able to pass through them now.< br><br>Make sure not to bring any local flora or fauna back into the enclosure. It would probably try to devour us all."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2218763299" "Destroy the Clockwork communication relay."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P989782745" "You need to destroy that clockwork communication relay.<br><br>The Clockwork are tireless machines. It won't take them long to bring a communication relay online, even in a hostile environment like that found outside of this enclosure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P550465175" "The forest seems to react to your presence. Even the grass moves beneath your feet."

